      "y": 620,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "The Public IP resource owns the internet-facing address. Application Gateway attaches that IP to its frontend, inspects requests with WAF, then resolves and forwards to the private Container App. The Container App never receives its own public IP.",
